{
  "about": "Message bodies as the Java and Go AceMQ libraries write them, so this library can be tested against another language's bytes rather than against its own. A codec that encodes and decodes its own output proves nothing about reading a Java or Go message; these are the Java and Go messages.",
  "how_these_were_made": {
    "go": "A program built from acemq-go-amqp/codec/{yaml,toml,xml,protobuf,avro}, calling the same functions those codecs call, with the same settings and the same library versions their go.mod files pin: gopkg.in/yaml.v3 v3.0.1 (yaml.Marshal), github.com/BurntSushi/toml v1.5.0 (toml.NewEncoder), encoding/xml from the standard library (xml.Marshal), google.golang.org/protobuf v1.36.10 (proto.Marshal) and github.com/hamba/avro/v2 v2.30.0 (avro.Marshal).",
    "java": "A program whose mappers are the bodies of YamlCodec.defaultMapper(), TomlCodec.defaultMapper() and XmlCodec.defaultMapper() copied out of acemq-amqp-codec-{yaml,toml,xml}, and whose Avro path is AvroCodec.encode copied out of acemq-amqp-codec-avro, at the versions acemq-java-amqp/pom.xml declares: Jackson 2.18.9 and Avro 1.12.0.",
    "protobuf": "Go only. protoc on this machine emits Java that needs a newer protobuf-java than the codec module declares; the protobuf wire format does not vary by runtime version, and the Python runtime was checked to produce these exact bytes for this message, so the Go sample covers both.",
    "proto_schema": "message OrderPlaced { string order_id = 1; int64 total_cents = 2; string tenant = 3; } in package acemq.test — the same message the .NET library's protobuf tests use."
  },
  "notes": [
    "Java and Go produce byte-identical XML and byte-identical Avro, fixed and framed alike.",
    "Their YAML differs only in list indentation and their TOML only in quote style; both pairs are the same document and both decode to the same value.",
    "The Avro framing is Confluent's: one zero byte, four bytes of schema identifier big-endian, then the body. Identifier 7 here."
  ],
  "avro_schema": "{\"type\":\"record\",\"name\":\"OrderPlaced\",\"namespace\":\"org.acemq.test\",\"fields\":[{\"name\":\"orderId\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"name\":\"totalCents\",\"type\":\"long\"},{\"name\":\"tenant\",\"type\":\"string\"}]}",
